      "q": "How much does Lumen Technologies Government Solutions make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "Lumen Technologies Government Solutions obligated $295M in federal contract dollars in FY2026 to date. Lumen Technologies Government Solutions has 348 awards this fiscal year and an average award size of $846K. The FY2026 total is fiscal year to date, so the figure is partial for the full year."
    },
    {
      "q": "Which agencies buy from Lumen Technologies Government Solutions?",
      "a": "The Department of Veterans Affairs, the Department of Defense, the Department of Agriculture, and the Department of the Interior are the largest buyers of Lumen Technologies Government Solutions in FY2026 to date. Those agencies obligated $75.5M, $55.2M, $50.7M, and $50.2M respectively. Other buying agencies in the top ten include the Social Security Administration ($19.9M) and the Department of Homeland Security ($12.1M)."
    },
